{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse yourself into the Songs of Silence universe with special digital treats for the biggest fans!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This collection of extras contains exclusive artwork, videos, and other material related to Songs of Silence, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Premium wallpapers: </strong>Songs of Silence is wholly about beautiful art nouveau illustration; here, you will find 4K wallpapers designed by our artists, especially for your PC desktop! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Video Dev Diaries</strong>, a series of videos with our development team members and voice-over cast. Learn about different aspects of the game, from inspiration to technical aspects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unique Steam Cosmetics:</strong> To show your love and devotion to Songs of Silence, including 3 high definition backgrounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collection of best video assets</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Main Theme</strong> track by Hitoshi Sakimoto!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Digital Artbook:</strong> 100-page digital art book (*) featuring stunning full-color illustrations from Songs of Silence in our signature Art Nouveau style. It also includes exclusive artwork and interviews with the art team!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">(*) Note that the art book will be delivered with a free update mid-April 2025.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2685660?t=1744102910","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2685660?t=1744102910","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685660/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744102910","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2685660/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744102910","categorie